@startuml Connix Entities - Level 2
title Entities - Level 2

package "Entities" {
  [Connection model] as connection
  [Message and endpoint values] as message
  [Event and rule model] as rules
  [Execution policy] as policy
}

connection --> message
rules --> message
policy --> rules
policy --> connection

note right of connection
  Protocol-independent role,
  lifecycle, and socket state.
end note
note right of rules
  Supported events, actions,
  and cycle scope.
end note
note right of policy
  ONETIME/PERIODIC behavior,
  trigger eligibility, no overlap.
end note

@enduml
